[Music]  I'm not a brilliant businessman I just  have enough common sense to see that  there's something that needs to happen  and so we jumped on it we provide  security solutions to the cannabis  industry there's more dispensaries in  Denver than there is Starbucks because  the federally insured banks are  prohibited from making marijuana money  we've got clients that you know are  making two three hundred thousand  dollars a month in cash and they don't  know what to do with it they have no  security training they're not security  minded looking for someone following  them and they might put it in a shoe box  or a pillowcase in their closet so they  use us to transport it in our armored  vehicles and we have safe storage in our  facility because the banks won't take it  I've been in the industry for about 15  years  my background is law enforcement in the  United States Marine Corps it was a very  unusual dynamic moving from arresting  those who use in smoked marijuana to now  defending the people that we deal with  they might meet you we're trained to  look for any choke points pinch points  ambush sites or anything that's going to  Fox our trucks in most of the banks they  want a degree of separation they don't  want a dispensary owner walking in with  $200,000 in cash that smells like  marijuana we actually have a service  where we wash we don't launder it we  wash the money we actually have a  machine that removes the marijuana  molecules so it does not smell like  marijuana and then we deliver it to the  banks there's now 23 green states our  intention is to be in every one of them  the potential for growth in the spaces  is unlimited for us  you

